    "detailed_description": "Plant Girls: Insect Invasion is a strategic tower defense game that revolves around the clash of two races: the lustful Cyborg Insects and beautiful Plant Girls.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139500/extras/acb22cfd5a05cab326da05a453517df9.avif?t=1749109789\" width=490 height=168 /></span><br><br>Set in a post-apocalyptic world of the once-empire city Detroite, try to deal with the aftermath of a tragic societal collapse because of man-made catastrophe they themselves created: the Cyborg Insects.<br><br>What will you do if your very own creation turned against you?<br><br>Will you let one failure stop you from something that will save the future?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW TO PLAY</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139500/extras/ff97ca983083211a522b02e47332a6a5.avif?t=1749109789\" width=490 height=164 /></span><br><br>Plant Girls: Insect Invasion is a strategic tower defense game in which you summon Plant Girls to prevent Cyborg Insects from attacking your base. <br><br>Your objective is to defend your base and eliminate the Cyborg Insects while destroying their Hive. <br><br>Your success in defending your base depends solely on your strategic skills.<br><br>Can you protect your people and defeat all those insects?",
